Holding the Legendary Trident, Zarad faced Yagditha.
But he held back when he was about to kill him. The god Zairweus rose from the Sphere of Life, confessing that gods also make mistakes and that he regretted his past decisions.
He opened a portal, taking the Aquarian spirits and Yagditha to have a new chance in a new world.
Zarad, now King, finally found his mother. Thanks to her, I perfected the Fusion technique.
Midranda has awakened! He recovered at the Spring of Zairweus, in the Sanctuary of the Abyss. His army is already on the move.
Take this document to Derik! We have no time to lose!

[Challenge Objective]

Take the Top Secret Document to Commander Derik.
